#### supports protocol/runtime matrix in one session

- Verify: supports protocol/runtime matrix in one session
   - Expected: output contains `"id":"abc-1"`
   - Expected: output contains `"capabilities"`
   - Expected: output contains `resourceTemplates`
   - Expected: output contains `project:///info`
   - Expected: output contains `Working Dir`
   - Expected: output contains `bugdb:///stats`
   - Expected: output contains `"health"`
   - Expected: output contains `"description":"Analyze file"`
   - Expected: output contains `"messages"`
   - Expected: output contains `"completion"`
   - Expected: output contains `"values":[`
   - Expected: output contains `src/`
   - Expected: output contains `"level":"debug"`
   - Expected: output contains `"roots":[`
